EmailTemplate.textOnly:
To {!Contact.FirstName},

Despite our several attempts to contact you and work out a resolution, we still have not heard back from you.  In one last attempt to work out a resolution, we are willing to offer you the following:

- Twenty (20) monthly payments of {!advpm__Matter__c.Settlement_Offer_20_Months__c}

If you wish to take advantage of this payment plan, please reach out to us to set up.  If you are unable to pay the above settlement amount, but still want to resolve prior to a possible lawsuit, please reach out to us via phone or email.
Thank you,

{!advpm__Matter__c.Lead_Attorney_Name__c} | {!advpm__Matter__c.Lead_Attorney_Title__c}

National Funding, Inc., the parent and servicing company of
Quick Bridge Funding, LLC
{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}
{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}
